 技能）\n目标：让“自主智能式工作”感觉像一个产品，而不是一个终端。","tags":["opencode","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://openwork.software/","releaseDate":"2026-02-07","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/different-ai/openwork/releases/tag/v0.11.30","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.30/DifferentAI.OpenWork.yaml","sha256":"63211f84835f6e06be47264e1357a93b79f412e626befbbe60a6281b7928ceec"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.30/DifferentAI.OpenWork.installer.yaml","sha256":"933b3e0042eef44193ee094f5dcc088038a3eb0fd4b87ff2cd6240af8a3c68b9"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.30/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"bc86b3e4800d53237b4e1c76880e71d8533cac0dfb415616afcb1ba6e2577e66"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.30/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"d8b8d952b7b099764d9b4cb443f4f79226c939d39d4211d3a6ebebe5e281746d"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.30"}